sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    box PUBLIC ZONE
        participant RS as Routing Service<br>trade-imports-<br>routing-proxy
        participant JF as Journey Frontend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-frontend
        participant FD as Front Door<br>trade-imports-<br>ins-frontend
    end
    box PROTECTED ZONE
        participant SS as Session Service
    end
    participant IDM as IDM

    B->>RS: GET /gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>no session cookie
    RS->>JF: GET /notifications/123<br>X-Forwarded-Prefix: /gbn-ag
    Note over JF: No sealed cookie value,<br>session service not called
    JF-->>B: 302 Location: /auth/sign-in<br>?redirect=/gbn-ag/notifications/123
    B->>RS: GET /auth/sign-in<br>?redirect=/gbn-ag/notifications/123
    RS->>FD: GET /auth/sign-in<br>?redirect=/gbn-ag/notifications/123
    Note over FD: Return path checked
    FD->>SS: POST /sign-ins<br>provider IDM, mode sign-in,<br>return path /gbn-ag/notifications/123
    Note over SS: state, nonce, code verifier<br>and binding value created,<br>round trip stored
    SS-->>FD: 201 Created<br>IDM address, binding value
    FD-->>B: 302 Location: IDM authorize endpoint<br>Set-Cookie: binding cookie
    B->>IDM: GET IDM authorize endpoint<br>?client_id, redirect_uri,<br>scope=openid {serviceId} offline_access,<br>state, nonce, code_challenge
    Note over B,IDM: IDM sends John to his credential provider,<br>which asks for his credentials.<br>John picks Northgate Produce Ltd
    IDM-->>B: 302 Location: /auth/callback<br>?code=…&state=…
    B->>RS: GET /auth/callback?code=…&state=…<br>binding cookie
    RS->>FD: GET /auth/callback?code=…&state=…<br>binding cookie
    FD->>SS: POST /sign-ins/{state}/completion<br>code, binding value
    Note over SS: Round trip consumed,<br>binding value checked
    SS->>IDM: POST IDM token endpoint<br>grant_type=authorization_code,<br>code, code_verifier,<br>scope incl. offline_access,<br>via CDP's outbound proxy
    IDM-->>SS: 200 id_token, access_token,<br>refresh_token (offline_access)
    Note over SS: ID token checked,<br>roles filtered,<br>record created,<br>value sealed
    SS-->>FD: 201 Created<br>sealed cookie value,<br>return path
    Note over FD: Session cookie set,<br>binding cookie cleared
    FD-->>B: 302 Location: /gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>Set-Cookie: __Host-ins-session
